    "zh": "你在诊所排队,还要等半个多小时。旁边坐着一个和你一样在等的人。你想随口聊两句。",
    "en": "You are waiting at the clinic with more than half an hour to go. Someone is sitting next to you, waiting as well. You want to make a little conversation."
